<title>FINLAND: ALL BUT ONE HELIBOR RATE FLAT AT FIX.</title>
<headline>ALL BUT ONE HELIBOR RATE FLAT AT FIX.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>All but one Helibor rate stayed</p>
<p>flat at the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on Tuesday. The</p>
<p>three-month rate was flat at 3.09 percent.</p>
<p>				 May 6 fix	   May 5 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor		  3.03 pct	    3.04 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor		  3.06 pct	    3.06 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor		  3.09 pct	    3.09 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor		  3.20 pct	    3.20 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor		  3.31 pct	    3.31 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor		 3.42 pct	    3.42 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
